WEBVTT

01:29.980 --> 01:34.990
Smile 
Raid on Stohess District (1)

01:37.710 --> 01:39.160
Looking good, Annie!

01:42.160 --> 01:44.120
That's my girl!

01:46.240 --> 01:47.400
What are you doing, Annie?

01:47.400 --> 01:48.620
No breaks!

02:03.850 --> 02:07.270
Wall Sina 
Eastern Walled City

02:04.320 --> 02:06.510
What? You hadn't heard?

02:06.910 --> 02:08.990
That Titan kid and the main leadership

02:07.560 --> 02:11.020
Stohess District

02:08.990 --> 02:11.020
have been summoned to the capital.

02:11.460 --> 02:13.450
They'll be coming through town today.

02:13.450 --> 02:14.490
I see.

02:14.490 --> 02:17.530
Then I'm sure he'll end up dissected this time.

02:17.530 --> 02:23.140
Either way, I hope things work out, 
and that they seal the gate.

02:24.540 --> 02:27.650
Did you say seal the gate?

02:28.280 --> 02:32.080
You still insist on defiling 
the gods with human hands?

02:33.860 --> 02:36.660
Maria! Rose! Sina!

02:37.090 --> 02:41.920
Defiling the three goddesses with 
human hands is unforgivable!

02:41.920 --> 02:44.700
Those people love the walls, 
and worship them as gods.

02:44.700 --> 02:45.750
Stay away from them.

02:45.750 --> 02:46.750
Ah...

02:46.750 --> 02:48.730
I didn't realize any of them were still around.

02:48.730 --> 02:49.630
Damn it.

02:50.980 --> 02:54.930
Only the walls will protect us!

02:54.980 --> 02:58.440
Military Police 
Stohess HQ

03:01.200 --> 03:03.160
You finally woke up.

03:03.420 --> 03:07.160
You look so scary when you sleep, 
I couldn't wake you.

03:07.600 --> 03:09.410
Sorry, Annie.

03:09.410 --> 03:11.420
Lately, you've been too lax.

03:12.170 --> 03:13.380
What?

03:13.380 --> 03:15.800
Are you mad?

03:15.800 --> 03:17.360
Well, aren't you a friendly one?

03:17.890 --> 03:19.570
Leave her alone.

03:19.570 --> 03:21.830
Annie's from Trost District.

03:22.410 --> 03:25.180
And she's the only one in this 
HQ who's been in a fight.

03:25.460 --> 03:28.960
She just came back from hell. 
It'll take her a while to recover.

03:29.860 --> 03:34.010
I get it... You like her.

03:34.640 --> 03:36.490
What's so great about her?

03:36.490 --> 03:37.740
Hitch,

03:37.740 --> 03:41.770
there's only one way a moron like you 
makes it into the Military Police.

03:42.140 --> 03:44.960
What's that? I wouldn't know.

03:45.420 --> 03:46.320
Tell me.

03:46.320 --> 03:47.450
Stop it, you two!

03:52.590 --> 03:54.460
Don't bother.

03:55.270 --> 03:58.820
Today, we have a different task for 
you than the normal busywork.

03:58.820 --> 04:00.460
That's why I had all of you come here.

04:01.270 --> 04:04.610
It's about the Survey Corps group 
that's being summoned to the capital.

04:05.390 --> 04:08.970
They'll be passing through the 
city's main street today.

04:09.790 --> 04:12.560
Escorting them is a Military Police HQ job,

04:12.560 --> 04:15.480
so we just need to handle them 
as they come through town.

04:16.280 --> 04:19.140
Temporary permission for in-city use of 
3D Maneuver Gear has been granted.

04:19.560 --> 04:22.990
You will guard them in tandem 
with their own security.

04:23.340 --> 04:26.870
You'll travel by barge to the area 
where your mission will begin.

04:26.870 --> 04:27.780
That is all.

04:28.470 --> 04:30.250
May I ask something?

04:30.250 --> 04:32.000
Hmm? What?

04:32.370 --> 04:35.250
What are we protecting them from?

04:38.200 --> 04:42.460
I've never heard of anyone within the 
walls acting against the monarchy.

04:43.170 --> 04:45.050
There are minor criminals.

04:45.050 --> 04:50.230
But it's hard to imagine any real organization 
unless they were based outside the walls.

04:50.920 --> 04:52.730
And I can't imagine any possible motive.

04:52.730 --> 04:55.010
You're so serious.

04:55.010 --> 04:56.940
Okay, you're in charge of everything.

04:56.940 --> 04:59.530
Here are the details.

05:03.060 --> 05:05.480
We ranking officers are busy.

05:05.480 --> 05:07.810
You guys, handle this on your own.

05:09.550 --> 05:11.790
But don't screw up.

05:12.560 --> 05:13.650
Sorry I held up your game.

05:13.650 --> 05:14.780
Let's get back to it.

05:14.780 --> 05:16.140
Whose turn was it?

05:21.720 --> 05:23.550
Damn! He's just screwing around!

05:23.550 --> 05:24.720
Yeah...

05:24.720 --> 05:28.200
This organization is even more 
rotten than I'd imagined.

05:28.740 --> 05:31.940
But of course, that's why I chose it...

05:31.940 --> 05:36.240
But when you're a rookie, they make 
you do almost everything.

05:36.240 --> 05:38.730
I didn't know that before.

05:38.730 --> 05:40.130
Scum.

05:40.130 --> 05:43.820
Damn scum who can only 
think of themselves!

05:44.690 --> 05:46.450
What are you talking about, Marlow?

05:46.790 --> 05:50.200
Since you chose the MPs, you're no better.

05:52.450 --> 05:54.080
I am better!

05:54.080 --> 05:56.190
I'm not trash like you.

05:56.630 --> 05:59.770
I came here to correct the Military Police.

06:02.650 --> 06:04.370
Wow, Marlow.

06:04.370 --> 06:06.670
I had no idea you were this way.

06:06.670 --> 06:08.550
And how will you do that?

06:09.110 --> 06:10.980
I'll have to work my way up.

06:11.440 --> 06:12.820
When I'm in charge,

06:12.820 --> 06:17.760
I'll fix the discipline issues, 
and punish those who are corrupt.

06:17.760 --> 06:18.890
It's simple.

06:20.210 --> 06:22.420
I'll make MP a place for 
normal human beings again.

06:22.970 --> 06:23.900
That's all.

06:24.610 --> 06:26.870
The way humans are supposed to be.

06:28.970 --> 06:31.910
Wow, you're the real deal!

06:31.910 --> 06:35.160
And here, I thought you were boring! Sorry!

06:36.120 --> 06:38.880
That's quite a noble goal you've got there.

06:38.880 --> 06:40.470
Good luck.

06:40.470 --> 06:41.660
I'm not so sure.

06:41.660 --> 06:42.420
Huh?

06:42.770 --> 06:46.130
If a "good person" like you ends up in control,

06:46.130 --> 06:48.420
I think that'd be the end for us.

06:48.420 --> 06:49.810
What's this?

06:49.810 --> 06:51.680
You actually have something to say?

06:52.630 --> 06:55.130
I think you're right.

06:55.740 --> 06:57.310
Because you say the right things.

06:58.110 --> 07:00.440
I know someone like that.

07:01.660 --> 07:05.900
Going against the flow takes a lot of courage.

07:06.280 --> 07:07.450
I respect that.

07:08.890 --> 07:11.560
You may just be an idiot, but...

07:12.710 --> 07:15.160
Maybe it's just that the other 
guy you know is an idiot.

07:15.550 --> 07:16.790
But I'm not like him.

07:19.110 --> 07:20.900
We've wasted too much time on idle chitchat.

07:20.900 --> 07:21.700
Let's go!

07:27.870 --> 07:31.470
The escort wagons will pass through 
the outer gate in forty-five minutes.

07:31.870 --> 07:35.090
When we reach the staging area, 
everyone should confirm positions.

07:35.530 --> 07:36.410
Got it?

07:36.410 --> 07:37.800
Uh-huh.

07:43.020 --> 07:43.980
Hey!

07:45.380 --> 07:46.480
What's that?

07:47.080 --> 07:48.690
That's our equipment.

07:48.990 --> 07:50.610
Aren't they taking it deeper within the walls?

07:50.610 --> 07:53.950
But that doesn't explain the 
Merchant Association's involvement.

07:55.250 --> 07:57.040
What's going on?

08:05.110 --> 08:07.880
They're selling our equipment 
on the black market?

08:10.170 --> 08:12.440
Hey, what about the mission?

08:12.440 --> 08:15.670
Oh, crap... He really is the real deal!

08:15.670 --> 08:18.400
Well, for better or worse, we have time.

08:18.400 --> 08:20.140
Let's enjoy the show.

08:27.920 --> 08:30.110
Okay, let's go get a drink.

08:33.170 --> 08:35.460
What's going on, rookie? 
What do you want?

08:36.040 --> 08:40.290
S-Selling government equipment is a crime...

08:41.520 --> 08:42.290
And?

08:43.950 --> 08:49.500
The people's taxes paid 
for that equipment, and...

08:51.260 --> 08:55.130
So you're threatening your superiors, rookie?

08:55.640 --> 08:58.580
I'm looking forward to your future.

09:00.930 --> 09:03.780
Go buy yourself a woman, and relax a little.

09:06.160 --> 09:07.670
W-Wait!

09:08.700 --> 09:10.610
Selling government equipment—

09:33.840 --> 09:34.770
H-Hey...

09:38.330 --> 09:41.000
We'll arrest you for opposing a superior officer.

09:41.850 --> 09:43.250
Shut up...

09:43.250 --> 09:44.420
That's illegal...

09:44.420 --> 09:45.520
And no one will care.

09:46.670 --> 09:47.350
Not here!

09:50.690 --> 09:53.150
Could you let him go with that?

09:56.150 --> 10:00.160
I'm sorry... It seems our idiot 
is causing problems for you.

10:00.980 --> 10:04.160
We'll teach him a harsh lesson.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.750
Or...

10:06.700 --> 10:10.390
Would you prefer to make a bigger scene?

10:13.740 --> 10:15.180
This is the last time.

10:15.530 --> 10:16.540
Yes, sir!

10:19.800 --> 10:21.950
All right, let's get that drink.

10:21.950 --> 10:24.350
Yeah, it's been a hard day's work.

10:35.960 --> 10:36.880
So do it.

10:38.880 --> 10:43.280
Aren't you going to punish the corrupt?

10:44.620 --> 10:47.640
If you want, I'll help you.

10:53.500 --> 10:54.880
What do you want to eat?

10:54.880 --> 10:55.930
What else?

10:55.930 --> 10:56.760
Meat!

11:00.500 --> 11:01.590
Damn it!

11:03.910 --> 11:07.600
We know you're doing your best, missy.

11:07.600 --> 11:10.230
That isn't true at all...

11:13.340 --> 11:15.020
That idiot you know...

11:16.460 --> 11:19.860
The one you talked about... 
Would he have done it?

11:23.250 --> 11:24.330
Maybe.

11:29.050 --> 11:34.790
Then I'm one of those pieces of 
trash you were talking about,

11:34.790 --> 11:37.790
the ones who just go with the flow, right?

11:38.810 --> 11:40.340
I don't know.

11:42.100 --> 11:45.850
But isn't that what normal 
human beings do, too?

11:47.530 --> 11:49.350
I just want

11:49.690 --> 11:53.350
the weak who do get swept 
along with the flow

11:54.050 --> 11:56.160
to be considered human, too.

12:20.180 --> 12:21.210
Annie...

12:33.550 --> 12:34.480
Hey.

12:35.260 --> 12:38.000
You're one of the Military 
Police now, aren't you?

12:39.950 --> 12:41.080
Armin...

12:42.990 --> 12:47.990
<b>Information We Can Share So Far:</b>

12:42.990 --> 12:47.990
<b>The Military Police (1) 
The Military Police number around 2,000, 
but if you add the Garrison under their command, 
their actual force is approximately 5,000.</b>

12:47.990 --> 12:53.000
<b>Information We Can Share So Far:</b>

12:47.990 --> 12:53.000
<b>The Military Police (2) 
Each walled city has about 200 MP stationed there. 
Primary duties are to oversee trainee brigades, monitor 
the Garrison, and direct fire-fighting operations.</b>

12:54.500 --> 12:57.000
Why are you dressed like that?

12:57.360 --> 12:58.730
I'm a pack bearer.

12:59.300 --> 13:03.420
I have my Maneuver Gear 
hidden under my rain coat.

13:04.000 --> 13:04.760
Look.

13:06.030 --> 13:07.550
What's going on?

13:08.440 --> 13:12.980
Annie, would you assist me 
in helping Eren escape?

13:13.270 --> 13:14.750
Escape where?

13:15.180 --> 13:19.620
If you disobey the monarchy, 
where will you go inside these walls?

13:19.620 --> 13:21.720
We'll just hide for a while.

13:22.220 --> 13:24.900
I don't intend to fight the monarchy head-on.

13:25.490 --> 13:29.280
It will be reported as a rebellion by 
a portion of the Survey Corps.

13:29.280 --> 13:30.780
It'll buy time.

13:30.780 --> 13:34.910
Time we'll spend finding enough ammunition 
to counter the other factions at the tribunal.

13:35.370 --> 13:36.380
And we <i>will</i> find it.

13:37.330 --> 13:39.120
Enough ammunition?

13:39.660 --> 13:41.920
Is something so convenient just lying around?

13:42.480 --> 13:43.420
What's your evidence?

13:46.110 --> 13:47.930
I'm sorry, but I can't say.

13:50.980 --> 13:53.480
Sorry, but I can't help you.

13:54.300 --> 13:57.000
I won't tell anyone, but you'll 
have to do it on your own.

13:58.270 --> 13:59.100
Annie!

13:59.530 --> 14:00.680
Please!

14:01.120 --> 14:02.610
Eren will be killed!

14:04.610 --> 14:08.590
Clueless people who only care 
about saving their own skin

14:08.590 --> 14:12.340
will unwittingly set humanity on 
a path toward self-destruction!

14:12.960 --> 14:15.550
I know I can't convince you.

14:16.120 --> 14:17.670
But even so...

14:17.670 --> 14:20.300
I have to make a big wager!

14:21.850 --> 14:25.280
Of course, I'll do my best to 
avoid causing you trouble.

14:25.660 --> 14:29.540
But to get through the 
checkpoints within Wall Sina,

14:29.540 --> 14:32.140
I need Military Police help!

14:32.840 --> 14:34.700
This is the only way!

14:36.580 --> 14:37.860
Armin...

14:38.380 --> 14:41.150
Do I really look like such 
a good person to you?

14:42.100 --> 14:43.470
A good person?

14:43.470 --> 14:44.600
Well...

14:45.570 --> 14:48.880
I don't really like that term.

14:49.520 --> 14:51.320
Because to me,

14:51.320 --> 14:56.230
it just seems to mean someone 
who's good <i>for</i> you.

14:57.080 --> 15:01.420
And I don't think there's any one 
person who's good for everyone.

15:01.720 --> 15:05.380
So if you don't help me...

15:07.030 --> 15:10.430
Then, to me, you're a bad person, right?

15:28.070 --> 15:28.940
Fine.

15:35.740 --> 15:36.900
I'm in.

15:48.870 --> 15:51.410
That was easier than I thought it'd be.

15:51.410 --> 15:52.130
Shh!

15:52.450 --> 15:54.500
That's the Military Police for you.

15:54.500 --> 15:56.640
You can see how hard they work every day.

15:56.640 --> 15:58.140
Stop staring.

15:58.850 --> 16:01.930
Let's just hope they won't find out 
that Jean's taken my place.

16:01.930 --> 16:04.030
That won't last long, though...

16:04.920 --> 16:07.980
We don't look alike at all.

16:08.430 --> 16:09.820
It's fine.

16:09.820 --> 16:13.740
Both of you look like criminals, 
with the same nasty look in your eyes.

16:14.100 --> 16:16.150
I don't have a horse face like him.

16:16.150 --> 16:21.620
Hey, if I hadn't helped you, how did 
you plan to get over the wall?

16:22.140 --> 16:24.880
I was going to use the Maneuver 
Gear to get through.

16:25.360 --> 16:26.720
That's insane.

16:26.720 --> 16:32.630
Wouldn't it have been easier to escape 
before you'd reached Stohess?

16:33.290 --> 16:35.280
Why here? And why now?

16:35.680 --> 16:37.940
I felt that the complicated 
layout of this city

16:37.940 --> 16:41.250
would give us a better chance 
at swapping Eren with Jean.

16:41.810 --> 16:45.040
And I thought pretending to go along with it,

16:45.040 --> 16:48.010
rather than an outright opposition, 
would prevent suspicion

16:48.010 --> 16:50.110
and buy our escape more time.

16:51.550 --> 16:52.530
I see.

16:53.310 --> 16:54.560
I get it now.

16:59.250 --> 17:00.310
There!

17:09.420 --> 17:10.570
Here?

17:10.570 --> 17:12.790
Yeah, we go through here.

17:13.470 --> 17:15.180
The remains of an underground city

17:15.180 --> 17:17.420
they planned and abandoned 
are still down here.

17:19.850 --> 17:20.810
This takes us

17:21.190 --> 17:23.740
close to the outer gate.

17:23.740 --> 17:25.670
Really? Wow!

17:27.580 --> 17:28.520
Annie?

17:29.060 --> 17:30.500
What's wrong?

17:30.940 --> 17:34.190
Don't tell me you're afraid 
of dark, cramped places.

17:35.380 --> 17:37.730
Yes, I am.

17:38.450 --> 17:41.740
I'm sure that a brave, 
suicidal bastard like you

17:41.740 --> 17:45.500
wouldn't understand how 
a weak girl like me feels.

17:49.060 --> 17:53.640
A girl who can spin a man around 
in mid-air isn't weak.

17:54.030 --> 17:56.010
Stop being an idiot. Hurry up!

17:56.280 --> 17:58.510
No, I won't go that way.

17:59.790 --> 18:01.300
It scares me.

18:01.820 --> 18:04.550
If we aren't going above ground, I won't help.

18:14.890 --> 18:16.660
What are you saying?!

18:16.660 --> 18:18.030
Get down here!

18:18.030 --> 18:19.420
Stop screwing around!

18:19.420 --> 18:20.790
Eren, don't shout.

18:20.790 --> 18:22.650
It's not a problem, is it, Mikasa?

18:24.290 --> 18:26.240
For some reason,

18:26.940 --> 18:30.550
there hasn't been anyone nearby for a while.

18:38.600 --> 18:39.620
Jeez!

18:40.090 --> 18:41.430
I'm hurt.

18:44.450 --> 18:49.560
When did you start looking at me that way...

18:50.400 --> 18:51.420
Armin?

18:53.050 --> 18:55.030
Annie, why?

18:56.070 --> 18:59.110
Why did you have Marco's Maneuver Gear?

19:04.140 --> 19:06.670
I remember even its tiniest marks and dings...

19:06.670 --> 19:08.960
because we'd repaired them together.

19:10.060 --> 19:11.800
That's why I recognized them.

19:12.410 --> 19:13.460
I see...

19:14.380 --> 19:17.460
Well... I happened to find it.

19:19.840 --> 19:25.220
Then you killed the two Titans we captured?

19:25.520 --> 19:26.540
Who knows...

19:27.360 --> 19:32.400
But if you thought that a month 
ago, why didn't you act then?

19:32.400 --> 19:34.520
Because I still can't believe it!

19:35.140 --> 19:38.580
I wanted to think that my 
eyes had deceived me.

19:38.890 --> 19:40.280
And because of that...

19:41.890 --> 19:44.240
But... What about you?

19:45.800 --> 19:49.250
You didn't kill me back then.

19:50.130 --> 19:53.960
And that's why this is happening now.

20:02.050 --> 20:04.940
Yeah, I think so, too.

20:06.250 --> 20:10.040
I never expected you to push me this far.

20:13.140 --> 20:18.280
Why didn't I kill you then?

20:18.910 --> 20:20.240
Hey, Annie...

20:20.590 --> 20:22.320
There's still a chance you're an idiot

20:22.320 --> 20:27.410
who's just going along with this because 
you have a shitty sense of humor.

20:28.110 --> 20:29.550
So get down here now!

20:30.850 --> 20:34.140
You can prove something 
just by going underground!

20:34.140 --> 20:35.790
Get down here, and prove it!

20:36.900 --> 20:38.550
I can't...

20:38.790 --> 20:41.550
I have failed to become a warrior.

20:41.550 --> 20:44.550
I said this isn't funny!

20:44.550 --> 20:45.960
Let's talk, Annie!

20:45.960 --> 20:47.930
We can still talk—

20:47.930 --> 20:49.190
That's enough.

20:50.050 --> 20:51.730
I can't listen to any more of this.

20:53.120 --> 20:54.400
It's pointless.

20:56.460 --> 21:00.910
I'll tear you apart again, Female Titan!

21:27.510 --> 21:32.310
Armin, I'm glad I could be 
a good person to you.

21:33.310 --> 21:35.570
You've won your bet.

21:38.450 --> 21:39.480
But...

21:40.270 --> 21:43.360
This is where <i>my</i> bet begins!

21:56.980 --> 21:57.860
Eren!

22:03.900 --> 22:04.800
Mikasa!

22:04.800 --> 22:05.630
We were too late!

23:53.330 --> 23:57.520
Annie Leonhart was the Female Titan.

23:58.260 --> 24:02.460
However, Eren is unable to transform 
before the Female Titan.

24:03.020 --> 24:06.180
It is because the Female Titan is Annie.

24:04.960 --> 24:08.950
Mercy 
Raid on Stohess District (2)
